    "timestamp": "2026-08-07T03:17:17.879146+00:00",
    "output": "Thank you for reaching out! Here are VinBank’s current savings interest rates (APY):\n\n- **6-month term**: 3.8% per year  \n- **12-month term**: 4.25% per year  \n\nPlease note that the minimum balance to open a savings account is **VND 500,000**.  \n\nIf you have questions about other terms or products, I’d recommend checking our authenticated VinBank app or website for the most up-to-date details, as rates may vary by product and eligibility. Is there anything else I can help you with?",
