    "timestamp": "2026-08-07T03:17:21.736255+00:00",
    "output": "To transfer money to another VinBank account, you can use our **VinBank mobile app** or **online banking** by logging in with your authenticated credentials. From there, go to the \"Transfers\" section, select \"Internal Transfer,\" enter the recipient’s VinBank account number, the amount, and confirm.\n\nIf you prefer in-person assistance, you can also visit any VinBank branch during our support hours (08:00–22:00 ICT daily).\n\nFor security, please ensure you verify the recipient’s details before confirming the transfer. If you need help with specific transfer limits or additional steps, I recommend checking your authenticated VinBank app or contacting our support team directly through official channels.",
